  "row_count": 21,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 629.81 K, boiling point of Hg; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 14.151$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 8.929 + 0.158 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.268 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ \n$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=8.929\\times10^{-3}T+0.079\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+0.268\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-2.759$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-629.81 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 17.032 - 1.515 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.182 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 24.050 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 17.032 + 1.515 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.182 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 12.025 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 25.475 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \n629.81-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 2.069 - 0.211 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.081 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 7.350 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ \n$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 2.069 + 0.211 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.081 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 3.675 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 6.797 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K based on Goldfinger (45). Other data estimated. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
      "Phase change: 629.81 K, boiling point of Hg; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 14.151$ kcal/mol.",
      "Heat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations:",
      "298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{\\circ} = 8.929 + 0.158 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.268 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$",
      "$H^{0}-H_{298}^{0}=8.929\\times10^{-3}T+0.079\\times10^{-6}T^{2}+0.268\\times10^{2}T^{-1}-2.759$",
      "Reaction equations (kcal/mol):",
      "298.15-629.81 K: $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = 17.032 - 1.515 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.182 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 24.050 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 17.032 + 1.515 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.182 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 12.025 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 25.475 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "629.81-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 2.069 - 0.211 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.081 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 7.350 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$",
      "$\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = 2.069 + 0.211 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.081 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} - 3.675 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} + 6.797 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$",
      "Sources: Enthalpy of formation at 298 K based on Goldfinger (45). Other data estimated."
